    "name": "Levitate Elixirs-Wild Blueberry, Lemon & Rosemary",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">INGREDIENTS: PNW BLUEBERRY JUICE,PURIFIED WATER, WHITE WINE VINEGAR, APPLE CIDER VINEGAR, RAW</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">WILLAMETTE VALLEY HONEY, ORGANIC CANE SUGAR, PROPRIETARY HERBAL EXTRACT BLEND OF (WILD LETTUCE*,CA POPPY*, KAVA*, CANE ETHANOL*,DISTILLED WATER), CITRIC ACID, LTHEANINE, POTASSIUM SORBATE,VITAMIN C AS ASCORBIC ACID, LEMON EXTRACT, ROSEMARY*, STEVIA, SEA SALT, DISODIUM EDTA *=ORGANIC</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Just pour 3 oz of chilled elixir over ice, add seltzer, Garnish &amp; voila! You’re done!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">750 ml / 25.4 fl oz</span></p>",
